//! Catalog-defined runtime and mixed primitives, independent of selfhost implementation coverage.
//!
//! # Details
//! The committed list comes from the canonical bootstrap intrinsic inventory. The corpus runner's
//! cheap catalog check compares it with `Intrinsic.inventory()` and its explicit phase metadata.
//! Only the authenticated sealed namespace may consult this list to distinguish an unimplemented
//! member from a misspelling. No ordinary library declaration receives compiler privilege.

import silk.usize

